# codebase-memory-mcp scope — production protocol graph only.
# Does not affect git. Discovery-time only (see DeusData/codebase-memory-mcp docs).
#
# Allowlist: contracts + common + interfaces (+ workspace manifests).
# Deny tests, test-only receivers, examples, docs-as-code, and non-protocol trees.

/*
!/contracts/
!/common/
!/interfaces/
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock

# Examples under allowlisted trees
**/examples/

# In-crate and package tests
**/tests/
**/test_snapshots/
**/*_test.rs
**/test.rs
**/tests.rs
**/testing.rs

# Non-code under allowlisted trees (Cargo.toml pseudo-nodes, READMEs)
**/*.md
**/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.toml

# Belt-and-suspenders if discovery ever sees other trees
/tests/
/services/
/mock/
/certora/
/docs/
/skills/
/scripts/
/configs/
/artifacts/
/vendor/
/.cursor/
/.claude/
/.github/
/mutants.out/
/mutants.out.old/
/target-mutants/
